ECOSYSTEM & DEPENDENCY INTELLIGENCE DATASET — ARBITRUM

---

Ecosystem Position

· Kategori Ekosistem: Layer-2 scaling solution (Optimistic Rollup)
· Primary Sector: Blockchain Infrastructure / Layer 2
· Secondary Sector: DeFi, Gaming, RWA (Real-World Assets), Institutional Finance
· Primary Chain: Ethereum
· Supported Chains: 100+ chains live or in development (Orbit chains, L3s, and partner chains)
· Sources:
  · https://docs.arbitrum.foundation/what-foundation
  · https://blog.arbitrum.foundation/arbitrum-in-2025-the-year-of-everywhere

---

External Dependencies

Dependency Name: Ethereum (Settlement Layer)

· Dependency Type: Chain
· Purpose: Settlement and security — Arbitrum One and Nova settle transactions on Ethereum mainnet
· Criticality: Critical
· Status: Live
· Related Entity: Ethereum
· Related Technology Component: Settlement Layer
· Sources: https://docs.arbitrum.foundation/what-foundation

Dependency Name: Sequencer

· Dependency Type: Infrastructure
· Purpose: Ordering transactions and submitting batches to Ethereum; introduces a critical dependency
· Criticality: Critical
· Status: Live
· Related Entity: Offchain Labs
· Related Technology Component: Sequencer
· Sources: https://cantina.xyz

Dependency Name: Data Availability Committee (DAC)

· Dependency Type: Infrastructure
· Purpose: Provides data availability for AnyTrust chains (Arbitrum Nova); a portion of fees is sent to the DAC
· Criticality: High
· Status: Live
· Related Entity: Offchain Labs; Data Availability Committee
· Related Technology Component: AnyTrust Protocol
· Sources: https://docs.arbitrum.foundation/dao-faqs

Dependency Name: RPC Providers

· Dependency Type: Infrastructure
· Purpose: Provide endpoints for users and developers to interact with Arbitrum chains
· Criticality: High
· Status: Live
· Related Entity: 1RPC, Alchemy, Ankr, and other third-party providers
· Related Technology Component: RPC Infrastructure
· Sources: https://docs.arbitrum.io/arbitrum-essentials/reference/node-providers

Dependency Name: Blockchain Explorers

· Dependency Type: Infrastructure
· Purpose: View transactions, blocks, addresses, and network activity
· Criticality: Medium
· Status: Live
· Related Entity: Arbiscan, Blockscout, Blobscan
· Related Technology Component: Block Explorer
· Sources: https://docs.arbitrum.io/launch-arbitrum-chain/integrations/infrastructure-providers

Dependency Name: Third-party Bridges

· Dependency Type: Bridge
· Purpose: Transfer assets to chains outside Arbitrum ecosystem or in expedited manner without waiting for complete finality
· Criticality: High
· Status: Live
· Related Entity: Beragam penyedia bridge pihak ketiga
· Related Technology Component: Bridge
· Sources: https://docs.arbitrum.io/launch-arbitrum-chain/integrations/infrastructure-providers

Dependency Name: Oracles

· Dependency Type: Oracle
· Purpose: Integrate offchain data with Arbitrum chain smart contracts
· Criticality: Medium
· Status: Live
· Related Entity: Beragam penyedia oracle
· Related Technology Component: Oracle
· Sources: https://docs.arbitrum.io/launch-arbitrum-chain/integrations/infrastructure-providers

Dependency Name: Indexers

· Dependency Type: Data Provider
· Purpose: Retrieve historic or application-specific data without interfacing through RPC endpoint
· Criticality: Medium
· Status: Live
· Related Entity: Beragam penyedia indexer
· Related Technology Component: Indexer
· Sources: https://docs.arbitrum.io/launch-arbitrum-chain/integrations/infrastructure-providers

